  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。大量支援 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">骷髏馬生成是一個極簡可設定的模組，允許骷髏馬自然生成，且骷髏會騎乘在馬背上。每當骷髏生成時，都有機會以騎乘者的形式出現。您可以設定它僅在地表生成，以及是否會在白天燃燒。</span><br><br></p><p>您可能也對 <span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/giant-spawn\" rel=\"nofollow\">巨人生成</a></strong></span> 或&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zombie-horse-spawn\" rel=\"nofollow\">殭屍馬生成</a></strong></span> 感興趣。</p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/spawn-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的生成包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>chanceSurfaceSkeletonHasHorse</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 0.05，最小值 0，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在地表生成的骷髏騎乘馬的機率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>shouldBurnSkeletonHorsesInDaylight</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，骷髏馬在白天陽光照射下會燃燒。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>onlySpawnSkeletonHorsesOnSurface</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，帶有騎乘者的骷髏馬只會在地表生成。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">評論功能已關閉，因為我無法在這麼多獨立的模組頁面上追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有任何問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
